\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Japan March foreign reserves rise to record high   \b0\par\par\uc2 548 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 April 2007\par 01:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (Adds details)   \par \par \uc2  TOKYO, April 6 (Reuters) - Japan's foreign reserves, the world's second largest, reached a record amount for the second straight month in March, as rising overseas yields boosted the interest rate income of bonds held in Tokyo's reserves, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday.   \par \par \uc2  The reserves totaled $908.958 billion in March, up $3.91 billion from February, when they topped $900 billion for the first time.   \par \par \uc2  A rise in the euro, which boosted the dollar value of Japan's euro-denominated reserve holdings, and interest rate income from deposits also pushed up the reserves, a ministry official said.   \par \par \uc2  The yield on the benchmark 10-year U.S. Treasury note <US10YT=RR> stood at 4.648 percent at the end of March, up from 4.570 percent at the end of February.   \par \par \uc2  Japan's reserves are second only to those of China, which holds more than $1 trillion of such assets. Russia ranks third, followed by Taiwan, according to statistics from the International Monetary Fund, the official said.   \par \par \uc2  But Tokyo's foreign cash stash could fall in coming months due to a policy change that took effect at the start of the fiscal year on April 1, in which Japan will begin using dollars from its reserves for overseas remittances.   \par \par \uc2  Before the policy change, announced late last month, the BOJ had delivered cash in yen to private financial institutions on behalf of the government and paid for the cost of converting the money into foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  "We don't know whether there will be a large-scale remittance at the beginning of the fiscal year, but if there is one, it would lead to a decrease" in reserves from April, the ministry official said.   \par \par \uc2  He said that the policy change is aimed purely at cutting government costs and that the ministry is not worried about the impact any fall in reserves would have on its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy.   \par \par \uc2  The policy change would only reduce Japan's foreign reserves by around 500 billion yen annually, he said.   \par \par \uc2  Overseas remittances in the 2005/06 fiscal year totalled about 570 billion yen ($4.8 billion), mainly for the salaries of government employees working abroad and military equipment costs.   \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakdown of Japan's external reserves is a state secret, but historical data on the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has mostly taken the form of dollar buying, suggests that most of Tokyo's hefty reserves are in dollars.   \par \par \uc2  These reserves ballooned after yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  worth a record 20 trillion yen in 2003 and a further 15 trillion yen in the first three months of 2004, as the government waged a campaign to prevent a rapid rise in the yen from derailing \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's then-fragile economic recovery.   \par \par \uc2  Tokyo has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market since then, as the world's second-largest economy has been enjoying modest but healthy economic growth.   \par \par \uc2  The reserves included $762.305 billion in securities and $125.678 billion in deposits. The rest includes IMF reserve positions, special drawing rights and gold.   \par \par \uc2  * Click on [ID:nT343132] for a table of main figures.       \par \par \uc2 JAPAN-RESERVES/(UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|J|ABN|M|E|RBN|U|D|NAT|RNP|DNP|PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070405e3450023n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
