\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF Confirms It Didn't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  In February  \b0\par\par\uc2 207 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Februar 2007\par 11:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't take any action in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for most of February, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Wednesday, marking the 35th straight month of inaction.  \par \par \uc2 The ministry has stayed out of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets for the past three years, as the Japanese economy continued to recover and the yen has remained trapped in a broad downtrend despite its occasional surges. Before the ministry halted its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in March 2004, it had sold a whopping Y35 trillion within 15 months to prevent yen rises from derailing the country's then nascent economic pickup.  \par \par \uc2 The finance ministry said Wednesday it didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  between Jan. 30 and Feb. 26. The result was just as expected by market participants.  \par \par \uc2 Wednesday's data covered trades that are settled in February. Trades in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market are settled after two business days.  \par \par \uc2 Highlighting the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's persistent weakness amid the nation's very low interest rates, the euro climbed to a record high versus the yen of Y159.63 on Feb. 23.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Takashi Nakamichi, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; takashi.nakamichi@dowjones.com \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 28-02-07 1001GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070228e32s000l6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
