\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  did not  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market in April  \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 April 2006\par 12:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, April 28 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not conduct any \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  between March 30 and April 26, data released by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  showed on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 It was the 25th straight month in which the ministry has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- the longest stretch since records began in 1991.  \par \par \uc2 The last time Japanese authorities sold yen to stem the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise was on March 16, 2004, when it was trading at about 108.60 to the dollar <JPY=>.  \par \par \uc2 The yen was around 114.15 to the dollar on Friday, easing from a three-month high hit the previous day after Federal Reserve Chairman Ben Bernanke gave the clearest sign yet that the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate raising campaign may be coming to an end.  \par \par \uc2 Japan sold 35 trillion yen ($306 billion) in the 15 months to March 2004, fearing that yen strength could could weaken overseas demand for exports and undermine a fledgling economic recovery.  \par \par \uc2 But steady growth is finally helping the economy pull free from a near decade-long bout of deflation, and in March the Bank of Japan ended its five-year-old "quantitative easing" monetary policy of flooding the banking sector with excess cash.  \par \par \uc2 ($1=114.21 yen)  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|J|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|U|NAT|RNP|DNP|PTD  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060428e24s00238\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
